WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:10.920
Well, the last time I cried was during an intense emotional experience

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.700
because I felt I was losing something in my life

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.980
but at the same time I was gaining something else

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.699
or I was recovering something much more important in my life

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.980
which was recovering myself

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.300
sometimes losing certain things in life

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.960
isn't losing but is also gaining

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.300
so at a certain moment I felt like I was losing

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.440
something that maybe symbolized a lot to me

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.700
but that was also keeping me trapped

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.359
tied down and cut off from some things that made me exist

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.180
as a person

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.520
so I was crying

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:02.180
but at the same time reflecting

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.580
that just as I was losing

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:05.820
I was recovering

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.240
or gaining that freedom

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:08.960
to be able

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:10.800
to come back to myself
